7f30f&oh=00_AQRFIFHVr45Ae8cQwd_egb9MYCSl6DXbxng2xX44CgvNTw&oe=6B0C6538"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR Wizards - Strategy PvP Game", "keywords": ["PvP", "Multiplayer", "Strategy", "Arena", "Wizard"], "long_description": "Are you a pure-blood, a muggle, or a half-blood? Are you a casual player or a hardcore one?  Do you enjoy to play at your own pace?  Or in an adrenaline-filled battle with others?  Are you 13 years old or 70 years old?  No matter what your background is, you will love this eye-catching, action-packed fun game.  \n\nThis is not just a VR experience.  It is a seriously fun, interactive, and competitive game where you will be playing as a wizard.  Your goal is to battle other wizards in realtime, or to defeat the slime monsters.  The game features:\n\nPVP Arenas: Up to 4 people playing against each other. Currently opens during \u3010the first 10 minutes of each hour\u3011.\nPVE Arena\nLeaderboard: PVE / PVP\n\nIn-game tournament and real-life tournaments will be hosted to decide the top wizards of all!  Top 100 players on the PvP Leaderboard will be invited to compete in a live event to be streamed in 2017.\n\nPractice daily.  Test your skills in PvP.  Get on the leaderboards! Become a legendary wizard!\n", "short_description": "VR Wizards is a VR eSports game featuring both PVE and PVP arenas, where its PvP arena can host 2-4 or more players to play at the same time.  Due to its fast and thrilling gameplay that requires strategy, agility, and responsiveness to plan, shoot, hide, and defend your enemies' attacks, the game is born to be a great eSports game suitable for players of all levels. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.xgameportal.com/html/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.xgameportal.com/html/terms.html", "publisher_name": "Narvalous, Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.narvalous.com/games/vrwizards/", "